  "ruleText": "Box 101.07 “Promoter” means “promoter” as defined in RSA 285:1, II, namely “any person, club, association or corporation sponsoring a fighting competition.”\n\nSource. #4420, eff 5-24-88; EXPIRED 5-24-94\n\nNew. #6256, eff 5-25-96; ss by #10482, eff 12-5-13; ss by #14498, eff 3-1-26",
